      "comment": "Good maiden but hard to go past GOD'S ENCHANTMENT (3) who returns from a break. Made debut in town and wasn't beaten far at Ascot when fourth before a long break. Trialling very well and will go close if runs to debut figure. AURA MAGNA (8) is nearing a win, the latest a close-up second at Belmont Park over 1200m when racing on speed. Will give a sight again. BIFF BAM BOOM (5) was well in the market on debut and boxed on fairly well before being swamped late. Has upside and can measure up to this. MY MALENA (9) also has upside and shouldn't be far away after the latest effort, a sound fourth over 1300m at Northam",
